1
00:00:00,777 --> 00:00:03,617
(Howard's Mother(voice):)Fly for God's sake.

2
00:00:03,821 --> 00:00:06,201
HOWARD:
Fine, I'll stay. You happy, crazy lady?

3
00:00:06,407 --> 00:00:08,867
(Howard(voice):)I sure as hell hope so,
because you're ruining my life!

4
00:00:09,035 --> 00:00:10,455
[DOOR SLAMS]

5
00:00:11,996 --> 00:00:15,706
(Leonard(into phone):)Hey, Penny, it's Leonard. Good news,
you can take your head out of the oven.

6
00:00:17,335 --> 00:00:19,165
(Sheldon(removing hernia support):)I guess I won't be needing this.

7
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,930
(Sheldon:)Oh, no.

8
00:00:27,387 --> 00:00:30,057
(Sheldon:)The new ones.

9
00:00:30,598 --> 00:00:33,348
[IN SINGSONG VOICE]
They're here.

10
00:00:34,394 --> 00:00:36,854
(Leonard:)Stay calm.
We don't know anything about them yet.

11
00:00:37,021 --> 00:00:38,941
[OBJECTS RATTLING]

12
00:00:40,316 --> 00:00:43,946
(Leonard:)- What are you doing?
- I'm checking for musical instruments.

13
00:00:45,196 --> 00:00:47,736
(Sheldon:)Does that sound like castanets to you?

14
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:49,529
The box says "kitchen."

15
00:00:50,076 --> 00:00:53,366
(Sheldon:)So? Do cocaine smugglers
write "cocaine" on the box?

16
00:00:56,291 --> 00:00:58,021
- Hello?
- Hello.

